        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("It was a couple more weeks of marching along the tracks before a chill breeze touched Rugnur’s group, washing over them from a side tunnel leading up to the surface. Had they reached the Northlands?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_41",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/cave-rails-beam.webp"),
            text: _("Much to his chagrin, Alanin was dispatched to scout further up the rails, but he soon came back and claimed the rails ended — the main tunnel was unfinished to the north. For this reason, Rugnur led the dwarves up the cold passage and began to search for the runesmith named Thursagan. Thursagan, the Sage of Fire."),
          },
        ],
      },
