        id: "ev_25",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Baglur",
            unit: "Baglur",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Alanin",
            unit: "Alanin",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 300,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Alanin",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.profile",
                value: "portraits/alanin.webp~BLIT(portraits/alanin-winter-overlay.webp,0,0)",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("Now where are we going, anyway? I’ve had to ride down cold, dark, unknown caves... it’s been quite harrowing, this trip had better be worth all that!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("We need to find the sage Thursagan and convince him to return to the citadel with us. He’s somewhere up here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("Well, how are we supposed to find him?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("His will probably be the only house up here. No one else is insane enough to live this far north! Even the elves won’t challenge us here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("Elves may not challenge us, but I’ve heard of many other dangers lurking in the far Northlands. Wolves and trolls, but even the snow and ice itself comes alive! We should be careful!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("Right, we’ll probably have to fight our way through to his house. But we need to find it first."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_26",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: "0-31,16-31",
            y: "0-20,0-30",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Krawg",
            type: "Gryphon",
            side: 1,
            x: 4,
            y: 23,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Krawg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Krawg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Krawg",
            text: _("Kwill yooo spakkk wit uus?!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("Aah! What is that?!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("Is that... is that a gryphon?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Krawg",
            text: _("Screech! <i>(Makes eye contact, bobs and cocks head.)</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("It’s talking to us! What do you want, gryphon?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Krawg",
            text: _("Krawg! <i>(Looks out over the icy taiga, turns gaze back toward the dwarves.)</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Krawg",
            text: _("Urrrsagan?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("Well, um, yes, Thursagan. Why, can you help us find him?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Krawg",
            text: _("Yes... <i>(Quickly shifts gaze to nearby woods, adopts a hostile stance, then glances back at the dwarves.)</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("Aye, trolls and wolves are closing in... sure, Krawg, we’ll help you fight them."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:show_objectives",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_28",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 19,
            y: 14,
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22event%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22moveto%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22%24unit.id%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22This%20is%20just%20an%20empty%20shack%2C%20where%20could%20that%20old%20Runecrafter%20be%20hiding...%20Wait%2C%20this%20scrap%20of%20wood%20is%20actually%20a%20trap%20door!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Baglur%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22C%E2%80%99mon%20out%2C%20Thursagan!%20We%20need%E2%80%99ya%20help%20with%20some%20serious%20business!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22%24unit.id%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22It%E2%80%99s%20no%20good%2C%20he%E2%80%99s%20not%20hiding%20under%20it%2C%20there%E2%80%99s%20just%20this%20collapsed%20tunnel.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Rugnur%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22We%20have%20to%20find%20him!%20Fan%20out!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Alanin%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22I%20don%E2%80%99t%20like%20this%2C%20we%20should%20stick%20together.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22set_variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22thursagan_hunt%22%2C%22value%22%3A%225%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$unit.id",
            text: _("This is just an empty shack, where could that old Runecrafter be hiding... Wait, this scrap of wood is actually a trap door!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("C’mon out, Thursagan! We need’ya help with some serious business!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$unit.id",
            text: _("It’s no good, he’s not hiding under it, there’s just this collapsed tunnel."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("We have to find him! Fan out!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("I don’t like this, we should stick together."),
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "thursagan_hunt",
            value: 5,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_27",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 15,
            y: 16,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
