                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:scroll_to",
                    x: -1,
                    y: 4,
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "$unit.id",
                    text: _("... and collapsed the tunnel. He got away!"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Rugnur",
                    text: _("He can’t get far, can he?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Baglur",
                    text: _("Aye, the search continues."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: 1,
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "narrator",
                    portrait: "portraits/thursagan.webp",
                    text: _("You are playing a dangerous game! I gave you my answer, now leave me be!"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Rugnur",
                    text: _("You don’t want to make a sceptre to contain the power of the Ruby of Fire? It would be quite a challenge, I could see why you wouldn’t want to touch it!"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "narrator",
                    portrait: "portraits/thursagan.webp",
                    text: _("Whoa, now! The Ruby of Fire, what is that, some worthless Wesnothian gem?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Baglur",
                    text: _("It is a Wesnothian gem, but it is also supposedly the most powerful magical artifact ever seen. Even an untrained hand can use it to cast fiery bolts as powerful as those of arch mages."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "narrator",
                    portrait: "portraits/thursagan.webp",
                    text: _("Oh, really? And what does the King of Wesnoth want us to do with it?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Rugnur",
                    text: _("Contain and intensify its power."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "narrator",
                    portrait: "portraits/thursagan.webp",
                    text: _("I see. The king would cast fire like a mage. Well, good for him. Send him my regards!"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "$unit.id",
                    text: _("He just ducked back down underground..."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:play_sound",
                    file: "rumble.ogg",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:scroll_to",
                    x: 4,
                    y: -1,
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:scroll_to",
                    x: -11,
                    y: -1,
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:scroll_to",
                    x: 4,
                    y: 4,
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:scroll_to",
                    x: -1,
                    y: -11,
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:scroll_to",
                    x: -1,
                    y: 4,
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "$unit.id",
                    text: _("... and collapsed the tunnel. He got away!"),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: 0,
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "narrator",
                    portrait: "portraits/thursagan.webp",
                    text: _("You people just don’t seem to understand! I’m out here because I want no part of the nonsense of kings and those who crave power!"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Rugnur",
                    text: _("No wait, I wasn’t clear! We need to contain this power, build some sort of magical cage!"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Alanin",
                    text: _("The Ruby causes madness, it is said. A magical cage that could protect the King would help us all."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Baglur",
                    text: _("Aye, a cage, and we can’t do it on our own, Thursagan. We need your skill and expertise!"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "narrator",
                    portrait: "portraits/thursagan.webp",
                    text: _("Hrmph, so you need to deliver this power to the king, but also seek to contain that foolish man... I see your dilemma, and I do love a challenge, so let’s build this powerful artifact. I expect it will take years."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:play_music",
                    file: "knolls.ogg",
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Baglur",
                    text: _("Good. Now, there are still wild animals here... we have to get back into the caves."),
                  },
