          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("If we want to make this work, we will need every rune-blasted edge we can get. If I have some time to set up shop at a keep, I can prepare a little rune-craft for your troops. My goods do not come cheap though, I will not stoop to trifling apprentice-work..."),
